{"ref":"BDB, שְׁמִטָּה","hw":"שְׁמִטָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמִטָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. a letting drop</strong> of exactions, a (temporary) <strong>remitting</strong>: <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּעֲשֶׂה שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.1\">Dt 15:1</a> (at end of seven years), v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.2\">2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי קָרָא שׁ׳ לי׳</span>; whence seventh year is <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנַת הַשּׁ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.10\">31:10</a>.","next":"BDB, שְׁמִירָמוֹת²","prev":"BDB, שָׁמַט"}